    "innovation": "This paper uses new stratigraphic constraints from EPICA ice cores, including methane variations and the \u00b9\u2070Be peak, to show that firn densification models overestimate the gas age-ice age difference during glacial periods, suggesting a smaller lag for CO\u2082 at the last deglaciation.",
